cheapino_kicad8.kicad_pcb is cut down from pcb/cheapino.kicad_pcb of
Cheapino by tompi, https://github.com/tompi/cheapino (commit eea27c0),
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Changes: only a part of the board is kept, as KiCad 8 saved it: the header,
net list and setup, every board graphic and text, seven footprints (one
mounting hole, JP1, D1, ENC1, U1, K1, J_2_RIGHT1), the first 60 segments
and 40 arcs, every via and the four smallest zones. Nothing kept was edited.
